# State Layer Pattern

```
Data Provider  →  HTTP via systemApiFetch + apiRoutes
Hooks/state    →  search, grid, form orchestration
Update Service →  notify grids to reload after mutations
```

## Data providers

| Base | Use for |
|------|---------|
| `AbstractSearchDataProvider` | Paged search |
| `AbstractEntityDataProvider` | Single-entity CRUD |

- Resolve URLs only through `apiRoutes` / `environment.apiRoot`
- File names: `{feature}-search.data-provider.ts`, `{entity}-entity.data-provider.ts`

## Hooks (UI orchestration)

| Hook | Use for |
|------|---------|
| `useAuthenticatedEntitySearch` / `Local` | Search + auth gate |
| `useEntityGridState` | Grid preset, paging, row actions binding |
| `useJsonSchemaEntityForm` | Schema-driven create/edit |
| Feature `use-{feature}-grid` | Compose the above + permissions |

## Update services

```ts
class AnimalsUpdateService extends AbstractUpdatedService {}
export const animalsUpdateService = new AnimalsUpdateService();
```

Call `trigger()` after successful create/update/delete. Pass the singleton into `useEntityGridState`.

## Models

Keep list/detail types under `state/models/` or `shared/models/`. Reuse framework `SearchRequest` / `SearchResponse` shapes.

